ion is 13\u00d7 revenue per employee (reasonable relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (8/10).","financial_summary":["Cytokinetics, Incorporated is a mid-cap healthcare business with a $7.1B market cap on $88M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at -2% over the past three years and +12% annually across the full decade, and a shrinking top line is the hardest headwind any business can overcome.","Returns on capital run at -166% against a 10% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","The company is burning through $535M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","On the balance sheet, thin -13.4\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and stock-based comp at 128% of revenue is silent dilution an owner has to account for, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 2/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (-2.1) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Very elevated short interest (19.7% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting against the business","sev":"red","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Operating margins 695% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $11.2M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Value-trap profile (score 58/100): leveraged balance sheet under pressure; roic below cost of capital \u2014 cheapness may reflect deterioration, not mispricing","sev":"amber","cat":"value_trap"},{"text":"Revenue growth lags most Healthcare peers \u2014 losing share inside the profit pool","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Healthcare peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"GLP-1 disruption across sub-sectors \u2014 weight-loss drugs are reshaping demand for orthopaedics, cardiovascular devices, and sleep-apnea treatments in ways not yet priced in.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Valued at a 171% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Healthcare sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 11% over 3 months","Healthcare ETF in a sustained uptrend above its long-term average","Strong 6-month sector performance (20.3% return)","Healthcare tends to hold up well as investors rotate into defensive names"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Cytokinetics (NASDAQ:CYTK) Stock: Insider Fady Ibraham Malik Sells 3,500 Shares","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/20/cytokinetics-nasdaqcytk-stock-insider-fady-ibraham-malik-sells-3500-shares.html","date":"2026-11-20","timestamp":1795171126.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.836,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Cytokinetics (NASDAQ:CYTK) Stock: Insider Jeffrey Hessekiel Sells 15,106 Shares","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/20/cytokinetics-nasdaqcytk-stock-insider-jeffrey-hessekiel-sells-15106-shares.html","date":"2026-11-20","timestamp":1795168374.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.922,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Reviewing Cytokinetics (NASDAQ:CYTK) and Immunocore (NASDA